OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre to reopen after
OL,4,Abacteria discovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leisure centre that was closed after
OL,7,Fthe detection of Legionella bacteria in
OL,8,Fits water system is set to reopen.
OL,10,FThe centre said it would open on Monday
OL,11,Fat 06:30 BST, after the water system
OL,12,Fhad been "thoroughly disinfected".
OL,14,FIt has been closed since Tuesday, after
OL,15,Froutine testing found the bacteria,
OL,16,Fwhich can occasionally cause
OL,17,FLegionnaires' disease.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
