OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre to reopen after
OL,4,Abacteria discovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on Facebook, it said: "The
OL,7,Fcentre's water system has been
OL,8,Fthoroughly disinfected to ensure that
OL,9,Fit has been completely treated,
OL,10,Foverseen throughout by subject matter
OL,11,Fexperts."
